    "field": "Index immutable eligible water vertices and cardinal neighbors once in original row-major order. Recompute dynamic heights/exposure with the original arithmetic. Restrict the identical edge predicate and cluster-start scan to nonspike vertices with a qualifying height difference. Cluster growth, classification and limits are unchanged.",
